{"id":2761,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为增强学生安全意识，明确寒假期间各项安排，我院于12月30日下午在15602H教室组织召开研究生主题班会。本次班会由我院团委书记刘莉莉主持，全体研究生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUzCLiUzVRUmvZoMlMfMz7aoz7aLRloPM4CiU4CZMz74L8L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hfoSy4LYhfMlUYnNn2L8Q7U4LPnllaMRVfMmNDL7lsMmVFLzC4MzvbnNnFLlnRMzlJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPozlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6195&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BA933A5D2FDF3FDC31EE041A6960E761/163579FD/1DC55\" vheight=\"226.69000244140625\" vwidth=\"302.3999938964844\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUzCLiUzVRUmvZoMlMfMz7aoz7aLRloPM4CiU4CZMz74L8L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hfoSy4LYhfMlUYnNn2L8Q7U4LPnllaMRVfMmNDL7lsMmVFLzC4MzvbnNnFLlnRMzlJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPozlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6195&e=.jpg\"></p><p>刘老师围绕安全工作核心并结合真实案例，从校园安全、出行安全、消防安全、网络安全及防范电信诈骗等多个维度展开讲解，提醒同学们切实增强防范意识；随后，刘老师对寒假起止时间、离校登记等事宜作出详细说明，并建议同学们合理规划假期，积极参与社会实践与理论学习，充实自我。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMmWLVUz9aMRMkLMmfVMlLiU4NDLlWokLzQ7U49aLz9Pozl0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yYU1yDLYhfnlVfLNVRn7CanzV7M8lYM7CZLN-aLzN8LNQFL4CPLR6kM4AFLmMVL4NJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPozlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6195&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/22B63AEAA2ACDF0E1D7E24F82B01942F/36107B78/23E39\" vheight=\"226.69000244140625\" vwidth=\"302.3999938964844\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMmWLVUz9aMRMkLMmfVMlLiU4NDLlWokLzQ7U49aLz9Pozl0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yYU1yDLYhfnlVfLNVRn7CanzV7M8lYM7CZLN-aLzN8LNQFL4CPLR6kM4AFLmMVL4NJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPozlJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6195&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次主题班会内容具体、针对性强，不仅有效强化研究生的安全防范意识和自我管理能力，更凝聚了学院对学生的关怀与期望。祝愿全体同学度过一个平安、健康、充实、愉快的寒假！</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUzCLiUzVRUmvZoMlMfMz7aoz7aLRloPM4CiU4CZMz74L8L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hfoSy4LYhfMlUYnNn2L8Q7U4LPnllaMRVfMmNDL7lsMmVFLzC4MzvbnNnFLl